#: lib/hddtemp.cc:499
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"hddtemp\" was not executed correctly, although it is executable. This is most probably due to the disks requiring root privileges to read their temperatures, and \"hddtemp\" not being setuid root.\n"
"\n"
"An easy but dirty solution is to run \"chmod u+s %s\" as root user and restart this plugin or its panel.\n"
"\n"
"Calling \"%s\" gave the following error:\n"
"%s\n"
"with a return value of %d.\n"
msgstr "„hddtemp” netika izpildīts pareizi, lai gan tas ir izpildāms. Visticamāk, diskiem temperatūras nolasīšanai vajadzīgas root tiesības, bet „hddtemp” nav setuid root.\n\nVienkāršs, bet netīrs risinājums ir kā root lietotājam palaist „chmod u+s %s” un pārstartēt šo spraudni vai paneli.\n\nIzsaucot „%s”, radās šāda kļūda:\n%s\nar atgriezto vērtību %d.\n"

#: lib/hddtemp.cc:513 lib/hddtemp.cc:536
